From ee2069bb51fdf90b5b80d08659f67b88b32fe482 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex <6953309+isarrider@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:26:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] avcodec/vc1: document frame threading with diagrams

Add diagrams and expanded comments for the frame threading design: the
pipeline overview, what vc1_update_thread_context() copies and why, how
field pictures double the line sizes, when setup is finished, how
progress is counted in frame and field pictures and how far it trails
decoding, and which reference rows motion compensation waits for.
Comments only, no functional change.

